        "en": "Pet owners report successful clinical outcomes across a wide spectrum of health concerns, including leg injuries, dental problems, and complex exotic pet illnesses. Reviewers appreciate accurate diagnoses and thoughtful therapies that help sick or injured animals recover their strength. Many clients praise the team for reliable treatment plans."
      },
