      "title": {
        "en": "Comprehensive care for diverse species"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the hospital's specialized ability to treat non-traditional pets alongside cats and dogs. Clients appreciate having a reliable veterinarian in San Antonio for hamsters, birds, and reptiles such as box tortoises. The staff takes time to handle delicate, exotic animals with tailored clinical caution and warmth."
      },
      "mentions": 22,
      "sentiment": "positive"
